{
  "comment": "The Brittle Star: where each studio parameter lives in the game. key = the studio's own key (the SHIPPED block in Docs/Studios/VesselStudio/brittlestar.html, the Unity build set); asset + field = the Unity field it becomes. BrittleStarConfig.asset rows use BrittleStarConfigSO's own field names; BrittleStar.prefab rows are the one-thumb transformer block and the trail spawner (each a single plain line in the prefab). Not mapped, and listed by --unmapped: the ElementalFloat ranges (speedModeAt0/At10, creationBlockAt10, rangeAt10, projectileScaleAt10, blastScaleAt10: nested in the asset), ringRadius / ringHalfThickness (BrittleStarHullBuilder C# defaults, not serialized), nucleusRadius (the game reads the cell's own) and skimGraceSeconds (SelfTrailContactConfig.asset, shared by the fleet). Edit this file, never the assets by hand.",
